{"3451560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PC Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 3451560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own computer store! Repair broken computers and earn the respect of customers! Build your own computers and tag them for sale! Purchase the newest computer equipment and sell them to enthusiastic gamers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR BROKEN COMPUTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diagnose and fix customer PCs by identifying faulty components, removing broken parts, and restoring systems to perfect working order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/974e82ed56baa50850d56b6350e2a7b7.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/974e82ed56baa50850d56b6350e2a7b7.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/974e82ed56baa50850d56b6350e2a7b7.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUY GAMING EQUIPMENT &amp; COMPUTER PARTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order the latest GPUs, CPUs, keyboards, monitors, and more. Use them to upgrade customer builds, complete repairs, or stock your shelves with hot-selling items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/9ac5e71b34b62e8ad0b4bbbcbb3c54db.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/9ac5e71b34b62e8ad0b4bbbcbb3c54db.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/9ac5e71b34b62e8ad0b4bbbcbb3c54db.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUT  ITEMS FOR SALE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the best gaming equipment and put them up for sale. Cater to gamers, streamers, and tech lovers looking for their dream rig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/a83ba1ce3b8ce56980a80d789d92b00b.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/a83ba1ce3b8ce56980a80d789d92b00b.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/a83ba1ce3b8ce56980a80d789d92b00b.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR STORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/04c27aff34bf05f9f6979a8237401fd2.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/04c27aff34bf05f9f6979a8237401fd2.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/04c27aff34bf05f9f6979a8237401fd2.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and detailed PC repair mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell a wide range of computer parts and gaming equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom PC building for resale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store customization and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer rating system—earn trust and attract more business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress from a small repair shop to a high-end tech emporium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own computer store! Repair broken computers and earn the respect of customers! Build your own computers and tag them for sale! Purchase the newest computer equipment and sell them to enthusiastic gamers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPAIR BROKEN COMPUTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diagnose and fix customer PCs by identifying faulty components, removing broken parts, and restoring systems to perfect working order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/974e82ed56baa50850d56b6350e2a7b7.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/974e82ed56baa50850d56b6350e2a7b7.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/974e82ed56baa50850d56b6350e2a7b7.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUY GAMING EQUIPMENT &amp; COMPUTER PARTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order the latest GPUs, CPUs, keyboards, monitors, and more. Use them to upgrade customer builds, complete repairs, or stock your shelves with hot-selling items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/9ac5e71b34b62e8ad0b4bbbcbb3c54db.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/9ac5e71b34b62e8ad0b4bbbcbb3c54db.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/9ac5e71b34b62e8ad0b4bbbcbb3c54db.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUT  ITEMS FOR SALE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the best gaming equipment and put them up for sale. Cater to gamers, streamers, and tech lovers looking for their dream rig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/a83ba1ce3b8ce56980a80d789d92b00b.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/a83ba1ce3b8ce56980a80d789d92b00b.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/a83ba1ce3b8ce56980a80d789d92b00b.mp4?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR STORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/04c27aff34bf05f9f6979a8237401fd2.poster.avif?t=1774890049\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/04c27aff34bf05f9f6979a8237401fd2.webm?t=1774890049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451560/extras/04c27aff34bf05f9f6979a8237401fd2.mp4?t=1774890049\" 